OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrest after
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a woman have been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a man was stabbed in Lancashire.
OL,9,FThe victim, a man in his 20s, was found
OL,10,Fwith stab wounds on Church Street in
OL,11,FDarwen town centre during the early
OL,12,Fhours of Sunday 20 September.
OL,14,FHe was given first aid at the scene
OL,15,Fbefore being taken to hospital by
OL,16,Fambulance, where he remains in a stable
OL,17,Fcondition, Lancashire Police said.
OL,19,FA man in his 40s has been arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of attempted murder and a
OL,21,Fwoman in her 40s on suspicion of
OL,22,Fassisting an offender.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
